{
    "title": "Fluvsies - A Fluff to Luv",
    "description": "Pet lovers and animal games fans, step into the magical world of super cute Fluvsies! Here, you'll find fluffy virtual creatures, the sweetest companions you can collect, nurture, and play cute animal games with! Join in, hatch eggs, take care of fluffy pet babies, and let the endless fun of animal games begin!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc23 <b>HATCH & CARE</b>\r\nHatch every pet from a surprise egg! Just pop two cute Fluvsies into a magical merging machine, and voila \u2013 a brand-new egg is ready to hatch! Grow your virtual pet, care for him, and play cute animal games together!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc3c <b>COLLECT ALL PETS</b>\r\nDid you know that Fluvsies have their own tiny pets? Collect all kinds of them: from cute bouncing pandas to adorable flying birdies! Each virtual pet is unique, and they love playing cute animal games with Fluvsies, so collect them all and let the fun begin!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89 <b>PLAY & HAVE FUN</b>\r\nExplore new virtual places and find great toys to play animal games with! Hatch, grow, and then watch every virtual pet bouncing around on an inflatable castle and jamming on cute musical instruments! Oh, and keep your eyes on magical boxes \u2013 they\u2019re full of surprises and can't wait to be opened!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf6c <b>ENJOY ANIMAL GAMES</b>\r\nDive into a super fun world of cute animal games! Hop from cookie to cookie to collect coins! Make your Fluvsie fly and swim! Find and unlock every hidden virtual pet! Cute Fluvsies want to play animal games with you, so hatch eggs and have fun!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf80 <b>VISIT FASHION SALONS</b>\r\nYour virtual pet wants to look stylish! Discover an amazing collection of fashionable items and cute accessories that will turn your Fluvsies into real pet fashionistas. But wait, there's more! Play animal games and get creative with adorable face painting designs too!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa1 <b>DISCOVER NEW AREAS</b>\r\nThe magical world of Fluvsies is full of incredible places! Your virtual pet can play animal games in the beach zone, cute garden, toy shop, and the purr-fect cat playground. Explore these areas, find cool toys, and play animal games with every fluffy and cute virtual pet!\r\n\r\nUPGRADE TO TUTOCLUB!\r\nSubscribe to enjoy a huge portfolio of animal games with extraordinary TutoClub features:\r\n- UNLIMITED GAME CONTENT: Exclusive access to complete animal games.\r\n- NO ADS: Smooth playtime experience with no interruptions.\r\n- SAFE SPACE ONLINE: A 100% family-friendly place with no unwelcome content.\r\n- REGULAR UPDATES: Access to all future updates, new game releases & additional content.\r\n- PREMIUM IN-APP PURCHASES UNLOCKED: TutoClub members enjoy exclusive content.\r\n- FUN FOR ALL AGES: Original TutoTOONS games designed for boys & girls aged 3\u20138 & up.\r\n- LEARNING THROUGH PLAY: Carefully curated selection of animal games that cherish creativity, self-expression, responsibility, attention to detail & problem solving skills.\r\nBecome a TutoClub member today & ensure enriching playtime experiences for your kids! Find out more: https://tutotoons.com/tutoclub/\r\n\r\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\r\n\r\nAbout TutoTOONS Cute Animal Games for Kids\r\nCrafted and play-tested with kids and toddlers, TutoTOONS games foster kids\u2019 creativity and help them learn while playing the cute animal games they love. Fun and educational TutoTOONS animal games strive to bring meaningful and safe mobile experiences to millions of children worldwide.\r\n\r\nImportant Message to Parents\r\nThis app is free to download and play, but there may be certain in-game items that can be purchased for real money. By downloading this app you agree to TutoTOONS Privacy Policy and Terms of Use.\r\n\r\nDiscover More Fun with TutoTOONS!\r\n\u00b7 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/@TutoTOONS\r\n\u00b7 Learn more about us: https://tutotoons.com\r\n\u00b7 Read our blog: https://blog.tutotoons.com\r\n\u00b7 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/tutotoons\r\n\u00b7 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/tutotoons/",
